Subject: [PATCH] mega_moe: small_m / large_m fused paths for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash on amd-aiter 0.1.29

Base: amd-aiter v0.1.29 (a0c4b69c14), as shipped in
vllm/vllm-openai-rocm:nightly-60bd6dd2edd175a1c55fd3488f871e4c3d2ef27d.
Apply in an aiter source tree or in site-packages: git apply <this patch> (paths aiter/...).
Replaces docs/patches/0001-0003 of main_1110 (their content is included): apply only this one.
Covers only aiter/ (op_tests/ changes of the same commits are left out).

Commits (git log --reverse v0.1.29..7e4e7e021):
  137618bc0 [FlyDSL] MegaMoEV2: enable and tune small_m / large_m for Kimi-K2.6 EP8 A8W4
  2a612fa90 [FlyDSL] MegaMoEV2: faster large_m payload dispatch
  344fc22e8 [FlyDSL] MegaMoEV2: tune the Kimi-K2.6 main path for 16K / 32K tokens a rank
  a60277609 [FlyDSL] MegaMoEV2: run the small-input op test on Kimi-K2.6
  9a5c7eb0e [FlyDSL] MegaMoEV2: enable small_m / large_m for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash EP8 A8W4
  79bb03386 [FlyDSL] MegaMoEV2: large_m at 16384 tokens a rank for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash
  0aded6237 [FlyDSL] MegaMoE AOT: add DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash and the MTPR 16384 fused paths
  168f0a237 [FlyDSL] MegaMoEV2 small_m: DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash DSpark draft MoE (E128 / top-3)
  97d364fa7 [FlyDSL] MegaMoEV2 small_m: any experts a rank / top-k and fused shared-expert slots (main_1110 0002)
  7e4e7e021 [FlyDSL] MegaMoEV2 small_m: GEMM2 pipelining and 256-column GEMM1 units (main_1110 0003)
